# Excludes for a local `docker build` of docker/Dockerfile.microvm. The shipping
# image is built by Lambda from a zip (scripts/build-microvm-image.sh) with its
# own excludes, so this file only matters if you build the image locally.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.deploy-dist
**/.wrangler
**/*.log
